SUMMARY:Godfrey LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nGodfrey LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\n \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person\nVIP: Front-of-House seating + Post-Show Meet & Greet available \nAbout Godfrey\nGodfrey is a Nigerian-American stand-up comedian and actor best known for his explosive energy and hilarious observations on culture\, race\, and everyday life. He has appeared on numerous TV shows and specials\, and his 2026 special “Rebel with a Cause” has been a massive hit with fans. With over 67 upcoming shows on his current tour\, Godfrey is one of the hottest comedians on the road right now. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up from one of comedy’s most dynamic performers\nSharp cultural commentary and hilarious storytelling\nVIP option with post-show Meet & Greet\nIntimate club setting at one of SF’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar and beverage service available\n18+ show — valid photo ID required\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s most beloved comedy venues\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood. With a capacity of over 400\, it’s the perfect setting for a big-name comedy show. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $35. VIP tickets include front-of-house seating and a post-show Meet & Greet. There is a 2 beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
