SUMMARY:Michael Blackson LIVE at Hollywood Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nMichael Blackson\, the self-proclaimed “African King of Comedy\,” brings his outrageous\, high-energy stand-up to the Hollywood Improv Main Room on August 13\, 2026. \nKnown for his hilarious accent\, wild stories\, and fearless crowd work\, Blackson has become one of the most entertaining live performers in comedy. He has appeared in Next Friday\, Coming 2 America\, and is a regular on radio and social media. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 9:45 PM PDT\nVenue: Hollywood Improv (The Main Room)\nAddress: 8162 Melrose Ave\, Hollywood\, CA 90046\nTickets From: $40\n\nAbout Michael Blackson\nMichael Blackson is a Ghanaian-American comedian and actor known as the “African King of Comedy.” He appeared in Next Friday and Coming 2 America and is a regular on The Breakfast Club. His live shows are known for explosive crowd interaction and non-stop laughs. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
