SUMMARY:Ms. Pat LIVE at West Nyack Levity Live
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nMs. Pat LIVE at West Nyack Levity Live\nGet ready for a night of unfiltered\, gut-busting comedy as Ms. Pat takes the stage at West Nyack Levity Live on Friday\, August 14\, 2026. Known for her brutally honest storytelling and fearless humor\, Ms. Pat delivers a stand-up experience unlike any other. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: West Nyack Levity Live\nAddress: 4210 Palisades Center Dr A – 401\, West Nyack\, NY 10994\nTicket Prices: $37.17 – $107.72\nAge Restriction: 21+ event\n\nAbout Ms. Pat\nPatricia Williams\, better known as Ms. Pat\, is a stand-up comedian\, actress\, and author who rose from a turbulent upbringing in Atlanta to become one of the most compelling voices in comedy. Her Netflix special Lottery Ticket and her hit BET+ sitcom The Ms. Pat Show have earned her a devoted fanbase. Her comedy is raw\, real\, and rooted in her extraordinary life story — from the streets to the stage. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect an evening of no-holds-barred stand-up comedy. Ms. Pat’s sets are known for their sharp wit\, personal anecdotes\, and the kind of honesty that makes audiences laugh until they cry. This is a 21+ event with a two-item minimum purchase in the showroom. No photography\, videography\, or recording is permitted during the show. \nVenue Information\nWest Nyack Levity Live is located inside the Palisades Center Mall at 4210 Palisades Center Dr A – 401\, West Nyack\, NY 10994. Free parking is available in the Palisades Center Mall parking lot. The venue features general admission seating (first-come\, first-served) with the exception of groups and premium booths. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $37.17 to $107.72. Grab your official tickets through TicketWeb or find resale tickets on VividSeats: \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nThis post 