SUMMARY:Corey Holcomb LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nCorey Holcomb is one of stand-up comedy’s most electrifying and unfiltered voices. Going from hanging in the hood to performing on Jay Leno’s Tonight Show\, Corey’s comedy genius transcends class and racial divides. If you understand English\, his humor will tickle your funny bone — and then some. \nKnown for his razor-sharp observations on relationships\, Corey has built a massive following with his unique brand of comedy that blends auditory and visual performance. His facial expressions alone can send an audience into hysterics. He’s been described as a cross between Rodney Dangerfield\, Ralph Kramden\, and a hurricane — and that’s not far off. \nBeyond stand-up\, Corey hosts his wildly popular podcast The Corey Holcomb 5150 Show\, which began on The Foxxhole and has since amassed millions of listeners on YouTube and CoreyHolcomb.com. He also stars as ‘Boonie’ on Adult Swim’s hit TV series Black Jesus \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Raleigh Improv\nAddress: 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 27519\nAge Restriction: 21+ (valid ID required)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required in the showroom for all guests. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is the Triangle area’s premier comedy club\, located in the heart of Cary’s Parkside Town Commons. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Raleigh Improv offers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue features general admission seating (first-come\, first-served) as well as premium booth options that include a $200 food and beverage credit. The full-service bar and kitchen menu make it easy to enjoy dinner and drinks before and during the show. \nParking is available in the surrounding Parkside Town Commons shopping center lots. The venue is easily accessible from I-40 and US-1\, making it convenient for guests coming from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chapel Hill\, and surrounding areas. \nWhat to Expect\nCorey Holcomb delivers a nonstop\, high-octane stand-up performance that leaves audiences breathless with laughter. His pace is frenetic\, his honesty is disarming\, and his humanity shines through every punchline. Expect sharp relationship commentary\, crowd-pleasing storytelling\, and the kind of raw comedic energy that only Corey can bring. \nThis is a 21+ event with a lively Friday night crowd. Arrive early to secure your preferred seats\, order from the full menu\, and settle in for an unforgettable evening of live comedy. VIP ticket options are available for a premium viewing experience. \nNo cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is permitted during the performance. All sales are final. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $35 – $100 (plus fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/corey-holcomb-live-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/34_Edp-1oY5NC.png
