SUMMARY:David Cross: Shootin' The Shit\, Seeing What Sticks LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout David Cross\nDavid Cross is one of comedy’s most celebrated and boundary-pushing performers — a comedian\, actor\, and writer best known for co-creating and starring in the legendary HBO sketch series “Mr. Show with Bob and David\,” his role as Tobias Fünke in “Arrested Development\,” and multiple acclaimed stand-up specials. \nHis comedy is sharp\, political\, and brilliantly absurdist\, tackling everything from American culture and politics to personal observations with a fearless\, uncompromising voice. “Shootin’ The Shit\, Seeing What Sticks” promises a fresh\, raw hour of material from one of stand-up’s most distinctive voices. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is Northern California’s premier comedy destination. Located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, this legendary club has been the go-to spot for world-class stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe intimate setting features general admission and preferred premium seating\, a full bar\, and a classic two-drink minimum. The room holds a few hundred guests\, making every show feel personal and electric. Ample parking is available in the adjacent shopping center. Note: the 7:00 PM show on Aug 14 is sold out — check for the 9:15 PM show or Aug 15 dates. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline performance of David Cross’s “Shootin’ The Shit\, Seeing What Sticks” tour. Multiple shows are available August 14–15\, so check for your preferred time. Expect sharp\, provocative\, and brilliantly funny stand-up comedy. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $68 – $95 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/david-cross-shootin-the-shit-seeing-what-sticks-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95825
