SUMMARY:Kevin Nealon LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nKevin Nealon is a beloved comedian and actor best known for his nine-year stint as a cast member of NBC’s Saturday Night Live (1986-1995)\, where he created iconic characters including ‘The Subliminal Man’ and ‘Hans and Franz\,’ and served as a recurring anchor on ‘Weekend Update.’ \nNealon received critical acclaim for his role in the Showtime series Weeds\, which earned multiple Golden Globe and Screen Actors Guild Award nominations. He has starred alongside Adam Sandler in numerous films including Just Go with It\, Anger Management\, Happy Gilmore\, and You Don’t Mess with the Zohan. \nHis dry wit and likeable demeanor have made him a fan favorite for decades\, and he continues to tour his stand-up comedy across the country. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nAdditional Shows: Also performing August 14 (9:30 PM) and August 15 (7:00 PM & 9:30 PM)\nFood & Beverage: 2-item minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club (LOL San Antonio) is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco\, just inside the loop and a few miles from the airport. \nThe intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat feels close to the stage\, making for an incredibly personal and engaging comedy experience. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, so guests can enjoy food and drinks throughout the show. Seating is first come\, first served by section\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best seats. \nLOL San Antonio is part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club network\, consistently bringing top-tier national touring comedians to San Antonio. \nWhat to Expect\nKevin Nealon delivers a full headlining stand-up set showcasing his signature dry wit\, clever observations\, and the kind of understated comedic genius that made him a household name on SNL. \nExpect a polished\, engaging performance that draws on decades of experience in stand-up\, television\, and film. \nThis is an 18+ event. Arrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy the full club experience with food and drinks before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $50 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through official and resale channels: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kevin-nealon-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX\, 78216\, USA
