SUMMARY:Bret Ernst LIVE at Pittsburgh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Bret Ernst\nBret Ernst is a nationally touring headliner who has earned marquee status on the Sunset Strip and is one of the most consistently funny comedians working today. \nBorn in New Jersey and raised in South Florida\, Ernst is best known to TV audiences from his recurring role on the hit Netflix series Cobra Kai and his appearance in Vince Vaughn’s Wild West Comedy Show. He has appeared on Comedy Central\, BET’s One Mic Stand\, Showtime’s Comics Without Borders\, and The Late Late Show on CBS. \nHis stand-up is sharp\, relatable\, and never vulgar — a rare combination that makes him a crowd favorite at clubs across the country. Fans consistently describe his shows as non-stop laughter from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, PA 15120\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAbout the Venue\nThe Pittsburgh Improv is Pittsburgh’s premier comedy club\, located in the Waterfront entertainment complex in Homestead\, PA — just minutes from downtown Pittsburgh. \nThe intimate showroom seats approximately 300 guests with excellent sightlines from every seat. A full-service bar and restaurant are on-site\, with a two-drink minimum per person. \nFree parking is available throughout the Waterfront complex. Easily accessible via I-376 and Route 837. Arrive early to enjoy dinner before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nBret Ernst delivers a polished\, high-energy stand-up set that covers relationships\, family\, pop culture\, and the absurdities of everyday life. \nHis quick wit and natural stage presence make every show feel effortless and genuine. This is a great show for date nights\, groups of friends\, or anyone looking for a quality evening of comedy. \nThe Pittsburgh Improv typically features a local opener before the headliner takes the stage. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $25 – $60 depending on seating and availability. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bret-ernst-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, Pennsylvania\, 15120\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/22905989-8b5f-453c-8eee-45218bd015b3_518811_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2-qTuZto.jpg
