SUMMARY:Yannis Pappas LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nYannis Pappas LIVE at Punch Line Philly\nGet ready for a hilarious night as comedian Yannis Pappas takes the stage at Punch Line Philly in Philadelphia on August 14\, 2026. Known for his razor-sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and explosive energy\, Yannis delivers a stand-up experience that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 1 hour before show)\nVenue: Punch Line Philly\nAddress: 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123\nAge Requirement: 21+ with valid government-issued photo ID (18+ with parent or legal guardian over 30)\nParking: Lot N: 49 Richmond Street | Lot S: 1025 N. Front Street\nDrink Minimum: 2-beverage minimum per person \nAbout Yannis Pappas\nYannis Pappas is a New York-based stand-up comedian and actor best known for his viral character “Mr. Panos” and his appearances on Comedy Central and various podcasts. He has headlined clubs and theaters across the country\, earning a devoted following for his bold\, unfiltered humor and storytelling style. Yannis is also the co-host of the popular “History Hyenas” podcast. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from one of NYC’s top headliners\nSharp observational humor and personal storytelling\nAn intimate club setting at one of Philly’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar service with a 2-drink minimum\nA night of non-stop laughs in the heart of Philadelphia\nMultiple show times available — check Ticketmaster for all options\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at 33 E. Laurel Street in the Northern Liberties neighborhood. The intimate showroom offers excellent sightlines from every seat\, full bar service\, and a lively atmosphere that makes every show feel special. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale marketplace). Prices vary by show time and seating. There is an 8-ticket limit per person. No refunds or exchanges unless the event is cancelled or postponed. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/yannis-pappas-live-at-punch-line-philly/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19123\, United States
