SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at Little Caesars Arena
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNate Bargatze is the #1 comedian in the world according to Pollstar — a Grammy and Emmy-nominated stand-up comedian\, New York Times #1 bestselling author\, actor\, podcaster\, director\, and producer who has redefined what it means to be a mainstream comedy superstar. \nHailed as “The Nicest Man in Stand-Up” by The Atlantic and “One of the Funniest People” by CBS Mornings\, Bargatze sold over 1.2 million tickets in 2024 alone and broke more than 20 venue records. Billboard declared he set the record for the biggest one-year gross by a comedy performer in history. \nHis Netflix specials — The Tennessee Kid\, The Greatest Average American (Grammy-nominated)\, and Hello World (Amazon’s most-streamed original comedy special in its first 28 days) — have made him a household name. His latest Netflix special\, Your Friend\, Nate Bargatze\, debuted on Christmas Eve 2024 and was a global top-10 show for two weeks\, earning three Emmy nominations. \nBargatze’s comedy is clean\, wholesome\, and universally relatable — the kind of humor that brings entire families together for a night of pure\, unfiltered laughter. His Big Dumb Eyes World Tour features all-new material and is one of the most anticipated comedy tours of 2026. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM EDT \nVenue: Little Caesars Arena — 2645 Woodward Ave\, Detroit\, MI 48201 \nPhone: (313) 471-7000 \nContent: Clean stand-up comedy — all ages welcome. \nAbout the Venue\nLittle Caesars Arena is Detroit’s premier sports and entertainment arena\, located at 2645 Woodward Ave in the heart of The District Detroit. Home to the Detroit Red Wings and Detroit Pistons\, the arena opened in 2017 and seats approximately 20\,000 for concerts and major events. \nThe arena features state-of-the-art sound and lighting\, multiple concession levels\, premium club spaces\, and excellent sightlines from virtually every seat. The venue is designed for large-scale entertainment experiences\, making it the perfect setting for a comedian of Nate Bargatze’s caliber and reach. \nLittle Caesars Arena is easily accessible from downtown Detroit\, with multiple parking structures and public transit options nearby. The surrounding District Detroit neighborhood offers dining and entertainment options before and after the show. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a world-class arena comedy experience featuring Nate Bargatze performing all-new material from his Big Dumb Eyes book and tour. His shows are known for their warmth\, storytelling\, and the kind of clean\, feel-good humor that leaves audiences of all ages in tears of laughter. \nThis is a full arena production with professional lighting\, sound\, and staging — a true event-level comedy experience. Bargatze’s ability to fill arenas while maintaining an intimate\, conversational style is what sets him apart from every other comedian working today. \nDoors open before showtime. Arrive early to find your seats and enjoy the full arena atmosphere. This is a family-friendly show — bring the whole crew. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $45 – $150 (prices may vary based on seat selection and demand) \nTickets are available now. Nate Bargatze has broken arena records across the country — don’t wait to secure your Detroit seats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-live-at-little-caesars-arena/
LOCATION:Little Caesars Arena\, 2645 Woodward Ave\, Detroit\, MI\, 48201\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.313presents.com/assets/img/Detroit-NateBargatze_BigDumbEyes_2025_600x600-a9ff8f45ac.jpg
