SUMMARY:Josh Johnson's Comedy Band Camp LIVE at Orpheum Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJosh Johnson is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, best known for his sharp wit\, incisive social commentary\, and effortlessly cool stage presence. A regular on The Daily Show and a Netflix special veteran\, Johnson has built a devoted following with his ability to tackle complex topics — race\, culture\, politics — with disarming humor and intelligence. \nHis 2026 tour\, Comedy Band Camp\, is a unique and ambitious live experience that blends stand-up comedy with live musical performance. Johnson brings together a full band to create a show unlike anything else on the comedy circuit — part concert\, part comedy special\, all entertainment. \nFans can expect Johnson’s signature blend of observational humor\, cultural critique\, and storytelling\, all elevated by a live musical backdrop that adds energy and spontaneity to every performance. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Orpheum Theatre\, 910 Hennepin Avenue\, Minneapolis\, MN 55403\nTicket Price Range: $39 – $125\nAge Restrictions: All ages welcome; some content may be intended for mature audiences\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Orpheum Theatre is one of Minneapolis’s most iconic and beloved performance venues. Located in the heart of the Hennepin Theatre District at 910 Hennepin Avenue\, this stunning 2\,600-seat historic theater has been a cornerstone of Twin Cities entertainment since 1921. \nThe Orpheum features ornate architecture\, plush seating\, excellent sightlines from virtually every seat\, and world-class acoustics — making it the perfect setting for a show that combines comedy and live music. The venue offers a full bar\, concessions\, and accessible seating options throughout. \nParking is available in several nearby ramps and surface lots along Hennepin Avenue and in the surrounding downtown Minneapolis area. The venue is also easily accessible via Metro Transit light rail (Government Plaza station is a short walk away). \nWhat to Expect\nJosh Johnson’s Comedy Band Camp is not your typical stand-up show. This is a full-scale live event featuring Johnson performing alongside a live band\, creating a dynamic and immersive comedy experience that blurs the line between concert and comedy special. \nExpect high-energy performances\, crowd interaction\, and the kind of sharp\, culturally aware humor that has made Johnson one of the most talked-about comedians of his generation. The Orpheum’s grand setting adds an extra layer of spectacle to what promises to be an unforgettable night. \nThis is a rare opportunity to see Josh Johnson in one of Minneapolis’s most prestigious venues — don’t miss it. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $39 to $125 depending on seat location. Purchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at-orpheum-theatre/
LOCATION:Orpheum Theatre Minneapolis\, 910 Hennepin Avenue\, Minneapolis\, MN\, 55403
