SUMMARY:An Evening With Kevin Smith LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAn Evening With Kevin Smith LIVE at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nLegendary filmmaker\, comedian\, and pop culture icon Kevin Smith is bringing his celebrated one-man show to Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa. An Evening With Kevin Smith is an unforgettable night of storytelling\, Q&A\, and laughs as the director of Clerks\, Mallrats\, and Dogma shares behind-the-scenes tales from Hollywood and beyond. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026 (also Saturday\, August 15)\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK 74135\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Prices: From $118 (General Admission) \nAbout Kevin Smith\nKevin Smith is the acclaimed filmmaker\, writer\, actor\, and podcaster behind the iconic View Askewniverse — the interconnected universe of films including Clerks\, Mallrats\, Chasing Amy\, Dogma\, and Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back. Beyond filmmaking\, Smith is a beloved live performer whose Evening With shows have become legendary for their hilarious\, candid storytelling and audience interaction. He is also the host of the popular podcast Hollywood Babble-On and a fixture at comic conventions worldwide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious behind-the-scenes Hollywood stories from Kevin Smith himself\nInteractive Q&A session with the audience\nCandid tales from the making of Clerks\, Mallrats\, Dogma\, and more\nPop culture commentary and personal anecdotes\nAn intimate\, one-of-a-kind evening with a true Hollywood legend\nMultiple show times available August 14-15\n\nVenue Information\nBricktown Comedy Club Tulsa is Tulsa’s premier comedy destination at 5982 S Yale Ave\, featuring an intimate stage\, full bar\, and dining menu. The venue’s close-up seating ensures every guest feels part of the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets for An Evening With Kevin Smith at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa start at $118. Multiple show times are available on August 14 (7:00 PM & 9:45 PM) and August 15 (6:00 PM & 8:45 PM). Limited tickets remain — book now! \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/an-evening-with-kevin-smith-live-at-bricktown-comedy-club-tulsa/
LOCATION:Bricktown Comedy Club\, 5982 S Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK\, 74135\, United States
