SUMMARY:David Koechner LIVE at Denver Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nDavid Koechner is a beloved comedian and actor best known for his iconic role as Champ Kind in the Anchorman franchise alongside Will Ferrell. He is also widely recognized for his years as a cast member on Saturday Night Live and his recurring role as Todd Packer on The Office. \nBeyond his acting career\, Koechner is a seasoned stand-up comedian who has been performing live comedy for decades. His stand-up is warm\, energetic\, and full of the kind of big\, physical humor that has made him a fan favorite. \nExpect a hilarious evening with one of Hollywood’s most recognizable comedic talents — a performer who brings the same infectious energy to the stage that he brings to the screen. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM MDT (Doors open at 6:15 PM)\nVenue: Denver Improv\, 8246 E 49th Ave #1400\, Denver\, CO 80238\nAge Restriction: 21+ event — valid ID required\nTwo-item minimum purchase required per guest in the showroom\nAdditional shows: August 15 (6:30 PM & 9:15 PM)\n\nAbout the Venue\nDenver Improv is Colorado’s premier comedy club\, located in the Northfield Stapleton shopping district. The club features a full-service restaurant and bar alongside its intimate showroom\, seating approximately 300 guests in a general admission format. \nThe close-quarters layout ensures every seat has a great view of the stage. Parking is available in the surrounding Northfield shopping center lots\, and the venue is easily accessible from I-70. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a headline stand-up comedy show featuring David Koechner. The performance runs approximately 90 minutes and includes an opening act. Seating is general admission — arrive early for the best seats. \nCell phones\, photography\, and video recording are strictly prohibited during the show. Late arrivals will not be admitted more than 30 minutes after showtime. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $78\, plus fees. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/david-koechner-live-at-denver-improv/
LOCATION:Denver Improv\, 8246 Northfield Blvd\, Denver\, CO\, 80238\, United States
