SUMMARY:Majah Hype LIVE at The Wilbur
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMajah Hype is one of the Caribbean’s most beloved and internationally recognized comedians\, known for his hilarious impressions\, infectious energy\, and unique ability to capture the essence of Caribbean culture through comedy. Born in Barbados and raised across the Caribbean\, he has built a massive following through his viral social media videos and sold-out live shows across North America and the Caribbean. \nHis comedy is rooted in the everyday experiences of Caribbean life — family dynamics\, island culture\, and the universal humor of human nature. Whether he’s doing spot-on impressions of different Caribbean accents or riffing on life in the diaspora\, Majah Hype delivers laughs that resonate with audiences of all backgrounds. His Boston debut at The Wilbur is sure to be an unforgettable night of Caribbean-infused comedy. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nAge Restriction: 18+ recommended\nTicket Prices: From $37 (avg. ~$71)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most iconic comedy and entertainment venues\, nestled in the heart of the Theatre District at 246 Tremont Street. This historic 1\,200-seat theater\, built in 1914\, offers a stunning blend of classic architecture and modern comfort\, making it one of the premier destinations for live comedy in New England. \nThe venue boasts excellent sightlines from every section — orchestra\, mezzanine\, and balcony — along with a full-service bar and a lively pre-show atmosphere. The Wilbur is easily accessible via the MBTA (Boylston and Back Bay stations on the Green and Orange Lines)\, and several parking garages are located within walking distance on Tremont and Stuart Streets. \nWhat to Expect\nGet ready for a high-energy night of Caribbean comedy unlike anything you’ve seen before. Majah Hype’s live show is a full-on experience — packed with impressions\, storytelling\, crowd interaction\, and non-stop laughter from start to finish. His ability to connect with audiences of all backgrounds makes this a show for everyone\, whether you’re from the islands or just love great comedy. \nThis is a solo headlining performance\, and Majah Hype is known for going above and beyond on stage. Expect the show to run approximately 90 minutes. Arrive early to grab a drink and get settled — this is one show you don’t want to miss a minute of. \nTicket Information\nTicket Prices: From $37 (average ~$71) \nSecure your seats through official Ticketmaster channels or find resale tickets through VividSeats: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/majah-hype-live-at-the-wilbur/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/3a6/bd4d65a6-3c4a-4573-b74c-4edb52fbb3a6_1175711_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
