SUMMARY:Alfred Robles: Vatos with Gatos LIVE at Brea Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nAlfred Robles: Vatos with Gatos LIVE at Brea Improv\nLos Angeles comedian Alfred Robles brings his “Vatos with Gatos” tour to the Brea Improv for a multi-night run in August 2026. \nKnown for his hilarious cat-loving\, street-smart comedy\, Alfred Robles has built a massive following through his viral videos and live performances. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout Alfred Robles\nAlfred Robles is a Los Angeles-based comedian known for his unique blend of street humor and cat-loving comedy. He has built a massive social media following and tours extensively across the country. His “Vatos with Gatos” tour celebrates his signature style of comedy. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up from one of LA’s most beloved comedians\nThe Vatos with Gatos tour — a unique comedy experience\nIntimate club setting at the Brea Improv\nMultiple show times available Friday through Sunday\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange County\, CA. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
