SUMMARY:Nikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nNikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nOne of comedy’s hottest stars\, Nikki Glaser\, brings her highly anticipated The Stunning Tour to the Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, CT on Friday\, August 14\, 2026. Known for her razor-sharp wit and fearlessly honest humor\, Nikki is riding a massive wave of popularity following her acclaimed roast appearances and sold-out tours. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM ET\nVenue: Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nAddress: 39 Norwich Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT 06339\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nParking: On-site parking available \nAbout Nikki Glaser\nNikki Glaser is one of the funniest and most fearless comedians working today. She has hosted and appeared on numerous TV shows\, specials\, and podcasts\, and became a household name after her show-stopping performance at the Tom Brady Roast on Netflix. Her comedy is bold\, personal\, and always hilarious. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of Nikki Glaser’s signature stand-up comedy\nCandid\, confessional humor that pushes boundaries\nOne of the hottest touring comedians of 2026\nA world-class venue inside Foxwoods Resort Casino\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Connecticut\n\nVenue Information\nThe Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino is one of New England’s premier entertainment venues\, located inside the world-famous Foxwoods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, CT. The theater offers excellent sightlines\, top-notch sound\, and easy access to dining and gaming. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $106. Secure your seats now before they sell out — this show is expected to be a hot ticket! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
